From 76fa43f540991b4d864e002ee4df9375b57fbca4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tunkoal <tunkoal@163.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:51:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] rothko: port frameworks/av integration to Android 17

Carry the final 23.2 device integration delta onto the official 24.0 tree.
Old upstream base: b6b36c1fdb3c6ffced822a054fbf035b544f0de2
Recorded device baseline: eca3bbce373b1652c35d587cc1e19ae9f4392ace
New upstream target: 1c5914737a1a89d0c5b3e52e8289019eab3f8cbf

Three-way tree integration and whitespace checks passed. Compilation and
24.0 device validation are pending. Historical reverted changes are
represented by their final net effect. The project migration record
LINEAGE_24_MIGRATION_20261114.zh-CN.md tracks companion repository pins.
